<PageTitle>Get Started — FlexCore</PageTitle>

<div class="docs-page">
    <h1>Get Started</h1>

    <section>
        <h2>Install</h2>
        <p>From NuGet:</p>
        <pre><code>dotnet add package FlexCore</code></pre>

        <p>Or as a project reference (during development):</p>
        <pre><code>&lt;ProjectReference Include="..\path\to\FlexCore\FlexCore.csproj" /&gt;</code></pre>

        <p>Source: <a href="https://github.com/wadoodachaudhary/FlexCore" target="_blank">github.com/wadoodachaudhary/FlexCore</a></p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>License</h2>
        <p>
            The FlexCore package on NuGet is released under the <a href="https://github.com/wadoodachaudhary/FlexCore/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank">MIT license</a>.
